+/* The pass looks for five sibling loop nests
+
+     Q = X Wq (+ bq)   K = X Wk (+ bk)   V = X Wv (+ bv)
+     per head and row: scores, running max, exp and sum, weighted sum of V
+     Y = C Wo (+ bo)
+
+   whose scratch buffers (Q, K, V, C and the score row) are local heap or
+   stack allocations, and proves that they compute exactly what `attn'
+   computes:
+
+   - every address is an exact polynomial in the dimensions and the loop
+     counters, evaluated with interval checks that rule out wrap-around in
+     every intermediate integer type;
+   - every floating-point operation, load, store and call in the nests is
+     matched against the instruction's definition, operand for operand and
+     in the same order, so results are bit-identical;
+   - every branch that is not a loop exit is decided under the runtime
+     guard 1 <= n <= ATTN_MAX_N, 1 <= e <= ATTN_MAX_E, h >= 1, d * h == e;
+   - stores do not alias any input, and the scratch buffers are only freed
+     afterwards.
+
+   The region is then preceded by that runtime guard; when it holds, one
+   `attn' replaces the whole region, otherwise the original loops run.  */
+
